WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.936 --> 00:00:02.852
- Girl's night!

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.304
(gasp) Where are my kids?!

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.999
I'm alone.

00:00:11.999 --> 00:00:14.489
(children's music plays)

00:00:16.664 --> 00:00:18.290
- Okay, let's go over the night:

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.732
you can only show two
pictures of your kids tonight

00:00:20.732 --> 00:00:22.239
and you can only check-in twice.

00:00:22.239 --> 00:00:23.015
- What can I get you?

00:00:23.015 --> 00:00:24.384
- I'll get a Howe chardonnay please.

00:00:24.384 --> 00:00:25.932
- Yeah, I'll get the same

00:00:25.932 --> 00:00:28.290
but can you only fill
it like a fourth full

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:29.553
'cause if I have any more,

00:00:29.553 --> 00:00:31.103
I'm just gonna pass out right here.

00:00:31.103 --> 00:00:32.379
Yeah, that's good, that's good.

00:00:32.379 --> 00:00:33.845
Jackson hasn't pooped

00:00:33.845 --> 00:00:35.842
and I just wanted to see if he had yet.

00:00:35.842 --> 00:00:36.412
Oh my gosh!

00:00:36.412 --> 00:00:37.162
He did it!

00:00:37.162 --> 00:00:38.830
Now tell me what color was it?

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.378
Was it more of a yellow or a green?

00:00:40.378 --> 00:00:41.626
You're not being descriptive enough.

00:00:41.626 --> 00:00:42.626
You know what?

00:00:42.626 --> 00:00:44.337
Just send me a picture.

00:00:44.337 --> 00:00:46.562
Does this look runny to you?

00:00:46.562 --> 00:00:47.344
Let me zoom in.

00:00:47.344 --> 00:00:48.542
Hold on, look at this.
- Oh, god!

00:00:48.542 --> 00:00:49.379
- Does this look runny?

00:00:49.379 --> 00:00:50.968
I love this song.

00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:53.617
This song Jax and I like
to dance to it like...

00:00:53.617 --> 00:00:55.139
- Oh, oh, god.

00:00:55.139 --> 00:00:57.079
This is not really...

00:00:57.079 --> 00:00:58.583
Don't do that in public.

00:00:58.583 --> 00:01:00.353
- What are you looking at?

00:01:00.353 --> 00:01:02.407
- You know, actually I'm
looking at, it was my,

00:01:02.407 --> 00:01:02.853
you know what?

00:01:02.853 --> 00:01:03.547
Come closer.

00:01:03.547 --> 00:01:04.556
Come here.

00:01:04.556 --> 00:01:06.334
Come on, sit over here.
- Sure.

00:01:06.334 --> 00:01:09.227
- It's my son's fourth
birthday party photos.

00:01:09.227 --> 00:01:10.527
He looks so cute!

00:01:10.527 --> 00:01:11.750
It was circus themed!

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:13.666
So this is his second birthday party

00:01:13.666 --> 00:01:15.096
and now it was western themed.

00:01:15.096 --> 00:01:16.698
My husband dressed up as a cowboy.

00:01:16.698 --> 00:01:17.593
Look at this one.

00:01:17.593 --> 00:01:18.349
- Your husband?

00:01:18.349 --> 00:01:19.766
- You hungry?

00:01:19.766 --> 00:01:20.753
I'm kind of hungry.

00:01:21.733 --> 00:01:24.373
- That's not what you bring to a bar.

00:01:24.373 --> 00:01:26.597
- If we're drinking,
we have to have snacks!

00:01:26.597 --> 00:01:28.591
This has been such a fun night.

00:01:28.591 --> 00:01:29.492
I'm gonna head out.

00:01:29.492 --> 00:01:31.077
I miss my kids.

00:01:31.077 --> 00:01:32.547
I'll see you next month!

00:01:32.547 --> 00:01:34.082
- It's only been an hour.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:41.337
(baby crying)

00:01:43.438 --> 00:01:45.137
- I need a break.

00:01:45.137 --> 00:01:47.096
Excuse me, would you mind?

00:01:47.096 --> 00:01:49.754
Does this look runny to you?

00:01:49.754 --> 00:01:51.671
It's my son's poop.

